ost estimation"},{"text":"Supply-chain management"}]}]},{"heading":"Marine Propulsion","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diesel engines"},{"text":"Gas turbines"},{"text":"Electric propulsion"},{"text":"Hybrid propulsion"},{"text":"Propellers"},{"text":"Waterjets"},{"text":"Shafting"},{"text":"Gearboxes"},{"text":"Marine fuel systems"},{"text":"Propulsion efficiency"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Future-focused topics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LNG"},{"text":"Methanol"},{"text":"Ammonia"},{"text":"Hydrogen"},{"text":"Battery-electric propulsion"},{"text":"Hybrid-electric ships"},{"text":"Fuel cells"},{"text":"Wind-assisted propulsion"}]}]},{"heading":"Ship Design Software","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A competitive Naval Architect should gradually build capability in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"CATIA"},{"text":"SolidWorks"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Maxsurf"},{"text":"NAPA or equivalent"},{"text":"ANSYS"},{"text":"MATLAB"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"OpenFOAM"},{"text":"ShipConstructor or equivalent"},{"text":"AVEVA Marine / marine design platforms"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not try to master every software package."},{"type":"p","text":"A stronger strategy is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["CAD","one ship-design platform","CFD","FEA","Python/MATLAB"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Classification & Maritime Regulations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the purpose of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IMO"},{"text":"SOLAS"},{"text":"MARPOL"},{"text":"Load Line Convention"},{"text":"COLREG"},{"text":"Classification societies"},{"text":"Flag-state requirements"},{"text":"Safety regulations"},{"text":"Environmental regulations"},{"text":"Structural rules"},{"text":"Survey and inspection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Major classification organisations to understand include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DNV"},{"text":"Llo